@startuml
!theme plain

title State Machine - AI Request

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Arial"

[*] --> Received
Received --> Authenticated: API key hợp lệ
Received --> Rejected: API key không hợp lệ
Authenticated --> PolicyChecked: policy hợp lệ
Authenticated --> Rejected: policy vi phạm
PolicyChecked --> BudgetReserved: ngân sách đủ
PolicyChecked --> Rejected: vượt quota/budget
BudgetReserved --> Routed: gọi AI Provider
Routed --> Completed: provider trả kết quả
Routed --> Failed: lỗi provider/lỗi mạng
Failed --> PendingReconciliation: cần đối soát chi phí
Failed --> Rejected: không phát sinh chi phí
Completed --> [*]
Rejected --> [*]
PendingReconciliation --> Completed: đối soát xong
PendingReconciliation --> [*]

@enduml
